      "role": "user",
      "content": "The discriminant is (-2)^2 - 4*3*(-6) = 4 + 72 = 76. So sqrt(76) = 2*sqrt(19) ≈ 8.7178. Then x = (2 ± 8.7178)/6. So x = (2+8.7178)/6 = 10.7178/6 = 1.7863 ≈ 1.79, and x = (2-8.7178)/6 = -6.7178/6 = -1.1196 ≈ -1.12."
